{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Factory 95 is a retro Windows inspired automation game about making a slide show factory\u2026 in a slide show! Manage your space, make increasingly complex slides and worry about Y2K in this minimalistic factory builder. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987250/extras/2cb76384f17105c04589e8ba0391128a.poster.avif?t=1757284465\" width=1170 height=458 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987250/extras/2cb76384f17105c04589e8ba0391128a.webm?t=1757284465\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987250/extras/2cb76384f17105c04589e8ba0391128a.mp4?t=1757284465\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a retro operating system as you complete tasks from your emails and download upgrades from the World Wide Web.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987250/extras/770a8fb564b162c0b4cc16308b60813c.poster.avif?t=1757284465\" width=1170 height=458 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987250/extras/770a8fb564b162c0b4cc16308b60813c.webm?t=1757284465\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987250/extras/770a8fb564b162c0b4cc16308b60813c.mp4?t=1757284465\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your Factories are built in a slideshow-making software, so you only have limited space to design systems and move resources. Send slides between pages, use filters, splitters and copy-paste buildings to create complex slides in a compact space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987250/extras/1856d22b76ddd64671f27c2b661cc943.poster.avif?t=1757284465\" width=1170 height=458 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987250/extras/1856d22b76ddd64671f27c2b661cc943.webm?t=1757284465\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987250/extras/1856d22b76ddd64671f27c2b661cc943.mp4?t=1757284465\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With multiple game modes, and hundreds of possible slides to create, you can flex your graphic design muscles and earn that long-awaited promotion!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro, Windows 95 inspired aesthetic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complex automation puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hundreds of possible slide combinations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lots of options for creating slides including colours, patterns, content and transitions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original, Windows 95 inspired OST</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Laid back problem solving experience with no lose state</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3987250?t=1757284465","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987250/5bc9c544c99beb22c9cd99e3f4979eb994052431/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757284465","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987250/2357a0f8f080e37c9dafdd6356fa31d977edca69/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757284465","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/ste